1
00:01:09,039 --> 00:01:10,170
Hurry up and choose.

2
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:17,840
Wait.

3
00:01:18,039 --> 00:01:19,100
I'll give it to you.

4
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,360
He Shi,

5
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:26,320
I can't believe

6
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:28,760
you could be so cruel.

7
00:01:32,479 --> 00:01:33,680
Li Zhangxin,

8
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,160
I'm warning you.

9
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:37,520
From now on in the He family,

10
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:39,000
you'd better behave.

11
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,400
If you dare to frame me and He Shi again,

12
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:46,200
I have plenty of ways to kill you.

13
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:55,960
It's my fault.

14
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,400
I didn't guard against He Shi.

15
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,320
Second Brother,

16
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:00,250
where there's life, there's hope.

17
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,160
They can run for now,

18
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:04,000
but they can't hide forever.

19
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:05,640
I never thought

20
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,960
He Shi would use me against you.

21
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:10,199
True.

22
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:12,320
From the moment he crashed into me,

23
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:13,160
family

24
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:15,240
meant nothing to him.

25
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,690
I won't let this tragedy happen again.

26
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:37,640
Yu,

27
00:02:38,079 --> 00:02:40,079
I've found a good match for you.

28
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:42,600
She is Liang Chunsheng,

29
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,280
the heiress of the Liang Group.

30
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,810
She's been studying abroad

31
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:48,000
and just came back recently.

32
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,079
Go meet her this afternoon.

33
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,360
I have no intention

34
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,440
of getting married right now.

35
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:54,600
This is an order,

36
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,000
not a discussion.

37
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,840
Marrying Ms. Liang

38
00:02:58,040 --> 00:03:00,320
will only benefit the He family.

39
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,600
She is a real beauty.

40
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,890
What are we doing today?

41
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:19,160
I'm going on a blind date.

42
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,840
You're still going to see other men?

43
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:26,520
Then

44
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:28,240
what are we?

45
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,720
A one-night stand.

46
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:33,650
You're just like these things.

47
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:35,360
Boring once tried.

48
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:37,240
Shut up.

49
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:38,320
Turn around.

50
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:39,440
Walk out.

51
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:40,680
Get lost.

52
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,400
I'm sorry.

53
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:02,760
I was delayed by some personal matters.

54
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:05,560
You look more handsome
than in your photos.

55
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:09,040
Sorry, Ms. Liang.

56
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:11,640
Actually, this blind date

57
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:12,920
wasn't really my idea.

58
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,040
And you don't look

59
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:15,900
like you're short of men, either.

60
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:16,800
So

61
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:17,800
why don't we just go back

62
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,959
and tell our parents it didn't work out,

63
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:20,640
okay?

64
00:04:27,960 --> 00:04:29,280
But I'm

65
00:04:29,280 --> 00:04:30,680
very satisfied with you.

66
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,900
You must be joking, Ms. Liang.

67
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,600
I'm serious.

68
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:39,600
A guy like you with good looks,
family background,

69
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,800
and character

70
00:04:41,159 --> 00:04:43,480
must have a lot of girls
chasing after you.

71
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,610
One more won't hurt.

72
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,200
I wouldn't mind.

73
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,200
I'm sorry, Ms. Liang.

74
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:52,060
I already have someone I like.

75
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:54,800
So you're not together yet.

76
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,480
I have no interest

77
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,440
in other women.

78
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:12,680
There's no man I, Liang Chunsheng, want

79
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:15,400
but can't get.

80
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:21,960
Where did all this come from?

81
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,640
Hello, Mrs. He.

82
00:05:26,640 --> 00:05:27,760
I'm Liang Chunsheng.

83
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:28,800
I brought you some gifts

84
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:30,080
for our first meeting.

85
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:33,600
You're too kind, Ms. Liang.

86
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,600
It's my pleasure.

87
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,720
Take these upstairs,

88
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:39,680
and ask the second young master
to come down.

89
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,610
Yes. Go quickly.

90
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:41,600
Come,

91
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:43,260
please have a seat, Ms. Liang.

92
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:46,640
That nanny I just saw

93
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:47,920
is quite pretty.

94
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,320
She's He Shi's wife,

95
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:51,520
Shu Roujing.

96
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:53,220
The eldest daughter-in-law.

97
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,680
What kind of pearls are these?

98
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:58,000
They look better than mine.

99
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,080
Really?

100
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:00,080
Liang Chunsheng,

101
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:02,680
what are you doing here?

102
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:04,800
Aren't you happy to see your fiancée?

103
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:07,120
Nothing is settled yet.

104
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:10,320
Where are you going?

105
00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:11,250
To find Xiaomei.

106
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:16,920
I heard

107
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,360
Mr. He recently found

108
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:20,280
his long-lost daughter.

109
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,520
It's this Xiaomei, right?

110
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,320
Yes.

111
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:25,280
Let me tell you,

112
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,520
you have no idea

113
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:28,600
how manipulative this woman is.

114
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:31,560
She actually disguised herself as a nanny
to sneak into the He family.

115
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,720
This one is pretty good.

116
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:33,480
Really?

117
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,210
Give it a try.

118
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:39,250
What are you whispering about?

119
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:42,760
You'll find out when the time comes.

120
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:45,720
Zhangxin,

121
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,600
if you need any help,

122
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,640
just ask.

123
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:49,960
I hope

124
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:52,120
I can be someone you trust.

125
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:53,880
It's nothing that serious.

126
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:58,200
I just saw Miss Liang arrive.

127
00:06:58,200 --> 00:06:59,480
She's quite pretty.

128
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,640
Aren't you going to keep her company?

129
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:01,720
I already rejected her.

130
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:03,650
I didn't expect her to show up here.

131
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:07,360
She's got her eye on you.

132
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,360
That's none of my business.

133
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,240
Anyway,

134
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:11,040
there's no way I'm marrying her.

135
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,040
Why?

136
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,120
She's so pretty,

137
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,160
and she studied abroad.

138
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,000
Zhangxin,

139
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:18,000
in my eyes,

140
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:19,920
you are the best.

141
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:22,800
You're quite biased

142
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:23,960
as a brother.

143
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,400
I hope one day,

144
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,000
we can be

145
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,520
more than just siblings.

146
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,530
Sister-in-law,

147
00:07:35,159 --> 00:07:37,040
It's not too late to call you
my sister-in-law now,

148
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:37,960
is it?

149
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,800
Ms. Liang,

150
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:43,440
You don't mind if I borrow
your brother for a date,

151
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:44,440
do you?

152
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:46,520
Then you should ask my brother,

153
00:07:47,159 --> 00:07:47,960
not me.

154
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:51,130
You're quite a reasonable sister.

155
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:57,080
I've heard Liang Chunsheng came today.

156
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:58,400
What a pity

157
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,200
I didn't run into him.

158
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:04,900
I'm talking to you.

159
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,720
Hurry up and help me change.

160
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:08,200
You're a grown man.

161
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:10,130
Can't you change your own clothes?

162
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:12,760
Interesting.

163
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:14,920
The sun must have risen in the west today.

164
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:15,480
You...

165
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:19,880
Ouch!

166
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,280
He Shi!

167
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:22,680
I'm no longer the Shu Roujing

168
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,480
who lets people bully her.

169
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,960
When did you...

170
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,160
Haven't you noticed I've been

171
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:29,690
leaving early
and coming home late recently?

172
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:32,840
This coach just won
the Lumpinee gold belt.

173
00:08:36,760 --> 00:08:37,600
All right,

174
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:38,440
take a break.

175
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,299
Good practice.

176
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:41,360
Zhangxin inspired me.

177
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,440
I can't be soft-hearted

178
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,919
with people like you.

179
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:45,280
Starting today,

180
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:46,160
we sleep in separate rooms.

181
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:47,040
You sleep in the guest room.

182
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:48,770
How dare you make demands of me!

183
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:54,920
Damn!

184
00:08:58,680 --> 00:08:59,720
Just you wait.

185
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:08,880
You actually let Shu Roujing
walk all over you.

186
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,440
He Shi,

187
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:12,600
you're really useless.

188
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:15,360
I'm useless?

189
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:19,080
I'll show you whether I'm useless or not.

190
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:25,400
Again?

191
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:26,840
Aren't you tired?
